00:39:46.850 --> 00:39:49.660
Damn, nakakapreskong!

00:39:52.790 --> 00:39:55.930
Court Lady Choi, ano ang nasabi ko?

00:39:56.600 --> 00:39:59.570
"Damn, nakakapreskong!" -

00:40:00.270 --> 00:40:01.800
yan ang sabi mo.

00:40:05.170 --> 00:40:08.080
Nagising yata ang hidden instincts ko.

00:40:08.880 --> 00:40:10.580
Nakakapanibago talaga.

00:40:11.780 --> 00:40:13.680
Hindi ko mapigilan.

00:40:16.020 --> 00:40:17.050
Crap.

00:40:18.690 --> 00:40:19.890
